  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Albergues de Bajos Ingresos</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Low-Income Shelters</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM&apos;S THREE MAIN OBJECTIVES ARE: (A) TO ESTABLISH A DIRECT DEMAND SUBSIDY PROGRAM TO FINANCE REHABILITATION AND IN-FILL NEW CONSTRUCTION FOR LOWMODERATE INCOME HOUSEHOLDS BY THE PRIVATE SECTOR; (B) TO STRENGTHEN HOUSING INSTITUTIONS, AND (C) TO REFORM POLICY.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
